==== About ====
This is the Miraheze Practice Wiki request Review Generator (PWR Gen for short), made by [[User:Person0192837465]]
with the goal to remove one of the barriers to entry when becoming a Wiki Request Reviewer (that is, talking to people
and doing practice reviews).

You can find me on Discord @person0192837465 in the Miraheze Discord server, ping me if you need any support
or if you have features you want to see!<br>
This tool has a git repository (it's not mirrored, but I keep them up to date with each other). You can find it on GitHub under <pre>tsj845/miraheze-pwr-gen/tree/website/usrscripts</pre>

==== Setup ====
Doing the setup up for PWR Gen is super simple! Just add the following to your [[Special:MyPage/common.js]]:
<pre>
jQuery(function () {
    mw.loader.load("/w/index.php?title=User:Person0192837465/PWR-loader.js&action=raw&ctype=text/javascript");
});
</pre>
Once you've done that just reload this page and you're all set!
